# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Local additions: this is a vendored copy of Servo v0.4.0 customized for
# this project. Keep the tracked history focused on what we might actually
# touch (ports/servoshell, components, build tooling); exclude upstream
# bulk/noise we'll never need to track here.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Web Platform Tests + perf benchmarks mirror — ~1.2GB of engine conformance
# tests, irrelevant to customizing servoshell.
/tests/

# Upstream project docs/governance — irrelevant to us.
